BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Much Ado About Nothing
DTSTART:20261101T000000Z
DTEND:20261101T022000Z
DTSTAMP:20261018T074323Z
UID:998684
DESCRIPTION:<p>Tom Hiddleston is Benedick.<br />Hayley Atwell is Beatrice.
 <br />10 weeks only.<br /><br />Two of their generation&rsquo\;s finest ac
 tors star in Tony&reg\; winner Jamie Lloyd&rsquo\;s joy-fueled reinvention
  of <em>Much Ado About Nothing</em>. This giddily funny and beautifully te
 nder battle of wits comes to Broadway after a record-breaking run in Londo
 n\, where it was named the &ldquo\;#1 Best Show of the Year&rdquo\; (<em>T
 ime Out</em>).</p>
LOCATION:Winter Garden Theatre\, 1634 Broadway\, New York NY 10019
END:VEVENT
